"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"汗かかない方法は？\n⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒⌒\n中田はかなり汗っかきで\nすごい汗を気にするんだけど\nゆったんブログに書かれてましたが一番効率的なのは\n「水を飲まない！」\nでも心配しないで！\nもともと人よりあんまり飲めない人だし、\n撮影とかでメイク崩れるとメイクさんに手間かけてしまうからだし、\nうちはバトン部のころにあんまり水分補給する時間なくてよくやってたから\nもう加減がわかるんだ！\n撮影が終わった瞬間飲むから！\n※よい子は真似しないでね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は乃木どこ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先週の続き＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/29/6439853/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆっきーな、せいらりん(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-15575":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなったけど、せいたんhappy birthday(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/12/07/1917937/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18歳♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもメンバー想いで優しいせいたんが大好きよ(〃▽〃)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、フレンチトーストパーティーしようね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shiraishi/img/blog/mai.shiraishi/img/2013/12/07/1917937/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おめでとうー♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"b